  REMARK    GeneRIF: In vivo, MsrB1 shRNAi can inhibit lung metastasis in
            metastasis model. In conclusion, MsrB1 regulates proliferation and
            invasion of u2os cells by affecting MAPK pathway and EMT, and MsrB1
